14
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Oh, we have this from Walter Underwood, who joined us in last week's podcast to review the troop leader guide, volume 1..

15
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:27,000
And Walter read and reviewed my book, The Scouting Journey, on Amazon.

16
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:28,000
